  exitDialoguesPassed:
    lastVerdict: 1
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - "See you tomorrow! I\u2019ll bring you something special. Maybe."
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - Keep that neck straight, officer. Desk work is awful for your posture.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - Thanks, comrade. Keep out of trouble now!
  exitDialoguesQuarantined:
    lastVerdict: 2
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Oh, a private room? How thoughtful of you!
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - I hope you have strong locks. For your sake, not mine.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - "You\u2019re just putting me in a box with more toys. Thank you!"
  exitDialoguesKilled:
    lastVerdict: 3
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Oh! What a surprise! I didn't think you had it in you!
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - "Look at all that red! It\u2019s even prettier than I imagined!"
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - Finally... the big... bright... joke... is over.
  quarantineExitLines:
  - A room of my very own? I'll have it redecorated by morning. You'll see.
  - They always think the lock faces the wrong way. That's what makes it fun.
  - Tell the other officers I said hello. Or don't. I don't actually care.
  killExitLines:
  - "You have very steady hands, officer. I have always\u2026 admired that\u2026"
  - "I\u2019ve been waiting for someone brave enough. Very good. Very good."
  - "My only regret is that I didn\u2019t get to show you\u2026 my collection\u2026"
  voiceAudioClips: []
  introDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 242a7c6ff56032042bda268337763211, type: 2}
  questionResponses:
  - question: Where are you coming from?
    earlyDaysAnswer: The factory! Long shift, but a great one. Very productive.
    midDaysAnswer: Oh, here and there. A few errands. Nothing you'd find interesting.
      Probably.
    finalDaysAnswer: Everywhere! The city is so quiet now. So many empty places to
      explore!
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: Nowhere! I haven't left in ages. I've just been... thinking.
      Resting. Mostly thinking.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: The factory! Running perfectly. Full crew. Very lively.
      Nobody has gone missing!
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Home! Very busy indoors. Extremely preoccupied with
      my hobbies. You wouldn't be interested. Trust me!
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  - question: Have you been experiencing any strange symptoms lately?
    earlyDaysAnswer: Me? No, no, no. I feel absolutely wonderful. Better than ever,
      actually!
    midDaysAnswer: My eyes have been a little dry. It makes it hard to blink. But
      I try not to anyway!
    finalDaysAnswer: I've never felt more myself. That's not a symptom, is it?
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: Oh, yes! Very dry eyes. Hurts to blink. And my grin
      aches a little. Small price to pay!
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: No eye problems whatsoever! I blink perfectly! Constantly,
      even! Very moist eyes! Very normal!
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Actually I feel terrible! Weak, tired, barely sleeping.
      Very much not myself at all! Ha!
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  - question: Who do you live with?
    earlyDaysAnswer: Just me! I prefer it that way. More room for my hobbies.
    midDaysAnswer: Just me now. My last roommate... moved away. Suddenly.
    finalDaysAnswer: No one anymore! The apartment is very tidy these days.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: My roommate Alexei! Great company. Very energetic fellow.
      Very lively!
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: Alexei is still there! Very quiet these days. Very still.
      But present! Definitely present!
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Just me! Always just me! I never had a roommate. I wouldn't
      know what to do with one!
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
  idleBarks:
    earlyDays:
    - You have a very nice neck, officer. Excellent posture. You should be proud.
    - I love this checkpoint. So many faces. I remember every single one!
    - Do you keep a list of the people who come through here? I keep my own. Just
      a hobby!
    midDays:
    - The alleyways at night are so quiet now, have you noticed? It is wonderful.
    - You should smile more, officer. Life is very short. Very, very short!
    - I have been keeping myself very busy lately. Very productive. Very fulfilling.
    finalDays:
    - You are one of the last ones still at your post. I find that admirable. Truly.
    - The city is almost entirely empty now. So much more room for everyone who remains!
    - I hope we keep running into each other here, officer. While that is still possible!
    uncannyEarlyDays: []
    uncannyMidDays: []
    uncannyFinalDays: []
  IDNumber: 1893438
